as $C$ but with the opposite orientation. \n\nFor line integrals with respect to $x,$ we have the following properties:\n\n- ${\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x$\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x$\n\nIn our case, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ -{\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x & =-{\\int }_{-{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ -16 & =-11+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ -5 & ={\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=-5.\n$$" 13194139535561 true] [17592186355200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355201 13194139535561 true] [17592186355200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355202 13194139535561 true] [17592186355200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355203 13194139535561 true] [17592186355200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355204 13194139535561 true] [17592186355200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355205 13194139535561 true] [17592186355200 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535561 true] [17592186355200 1041 "selection" 13194139535561 true] [17592186355200 1104 #edb/ref 17592186355202 13194139535561 true] [17592186355200 1110 #uuid "f253d9bb-faac-51ac-8b6d-7592402df3fa" 13194139535561 true] [17592186355201 1034 "22" 13194139535561 true] [17592186355201 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535561 true] [17592186355201 1111 #uuid "3cfe5bca-101d-5cd3-a466-35407eba8301" 13194139535561 true] [17592186355202 1034 "-5" 13194139535561 true] [17592186355202 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535561 true] [17592186355202 1111 #uuid "25fb84d7-df97-52d5-9044-e02de8cb6f80" 13194139535561 true] [17592186355203 1034 "-27" 13194139535561 true] [17592186355203 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535561 true] [17592186355203 1111 #uuid "d7a199a0-2eb6-5db1-89fa-2aab139b3a01" 13194139535561 true]